{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Add it to your wishlist now and you will be notified as soon as the game is released~</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players assume the role of a waiter on a luxury cruise ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily tasks include cleaning guest rooms in the Guest Room Area to earn money, which can be spent at the Convenience Store located below the Commercial Area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely move around the ship, chatting with various NPCs and triggering unique storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some NPCs may irritate players, but player can use  superpower to make them admit their mistakes and improve the ship's environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Up to 20 characters with various professions and backgrounds* </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managers, bodyguards, housewives, cleaning ladies, dancers, swimsuit sisters, waiters, financial experts, convenience store clerks, and more! Discover more characters in the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*The game includes a storyline ending* </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can still play with your saved progress after the ending.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987810?t=1759036728","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987810?t=1759036728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987810/e8dabdc0c081647b3e852b53ea3957e721673d87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759036728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987810/e8dabdc0c081647b3e852b53ea3957e721673d87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759036728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Add it to your wishlist now and you will be notified as soon as the game is released~</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players assume the role of a waiter on a luxury cruise ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily tasks include cleaning guest rooms in the Guest Room Area to earn money, which can be spent at the Convenience Store located below the Commercial Area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely move around the ship, chatting with various NPCs and triggering unique storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some NPCs may irritate players, but player can use  superpower to make them admit their mistakes and improve the ship's environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Up to 20 characters with various professions and backgrounds* </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managers, bodyguards, housewives, cleaning ladies, dancers, swimsuit sisters, waiters, financial experts, convenience store clerks, and more! Discover more characters in the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*The game includes a storyline ending* </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can still play with your saved progress after the ending.</p>","developers":["KAWAKUCHI"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987810/e814c4e3c7e0c5ee2954fd184c375cea0b02518d/header.jpg?t=1759036728","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3987810/1843190466/290acd460928341639dcb6e55f894b3206c36f08/1756214755/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759031972","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3987810/1843190466/290acd460928341639dcb6e55f894b320